<Base title="Lab" description="what adrian lumley builds hands-on: a public evidence ledger for enterprise ai and a few small tools.">
  <PageIntro title="lab" standfirst="what i build hands-on: a public evidence ledger for enterprise ai and a few small tools." />

  <section id="past-the-pilot" aria-labelledby="past-the-pilot-h">
    <p class="label">flagship</p>
    <h2 id="past-the-pilot-h">past the pilot</h2>
    <p class="measure mt-3">a public evidence ledger for enterprise ai that made it into real work. 25 named systems, 74 sources, and every claim tied to a receipt.</p>
    <p class="links mt-4"><a href="https://pastthepilot.adrianlumley.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open the ledger</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" id="fork" aria-labelledby="fork-h">
    <p class="label">tool</p>
    <h2 id="fork-h">fork</h2>
    <p class="measure mt-3">one hard decision, three futures, three marks each. fork draws them as one map, in ink and pencil, and hands the decision back. no account, no ai, nothing leaves the page.</p>
    <p class="links mt-4"><a href="/lab/fork/">open fork</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" id="meeting-price-tag" aria-labelledby="meeting-price-tag-h">
    <p class="label">tool</p>
    <h2 id="meeting-price-tag-h">meeting price tag</h2>
    <p class="measure mt-3">a running dollar count for the meeting you are sitting in. pick the room, start the clock, and watch what the hour costs.</p>
    <p class="links mt-4"><a href="/lab/meeting-cost/">open meeting price tag</a> · <a href="/writing/meeting-cost/">why i built it</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" id="ink-field" aria-labelledby="ink-field-h">
    <p class="label">study</p>
    <h2 id="ink-field-h">ink field</h2>
    <p class="measure mt-3">a living sumi-e study. sumi ink pours onto warm bone paper and drifts through a seeded noise field, with rare embers of clay. tap the paper to pour, then save the print. it runs on nothing but a single html file.</p>
    <p class="links mt-4"><a href="/lab/ink-field/">open ink field</a> · <a href="https://github.com/prime3679/ink-field" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">source</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
